      "message": "Just a note on this -\n\nIt (specifying offset in p_paddr) used to be possible before these changes were introduced. \n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/crosvm/+/3673613/9/kernel_loader/src/lib.rs\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/crosvm/+/3673612/10/kernel_loader/src/lib.rs\n\nI am trying to bring back that functionality with this change so that both options can be supported with the current code.",
